    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Frequency </strong>once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger </strong>An ally within 30 feet of you makes a saving throw against an effect with the fear trait.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You can use your reaction with a shout to reinforce your ally's courage in battle. If your ally can hear you, your ally gains a +2 circumstance bonus to their save.</p>\n<p><strong>Special</strong> You can use your reaction after you know the result of the check.</p>"
